                "loc": "1KI.9.10+1KI.9.11+1KI.9.12+1KI.9.13+1KI.9.14+1KI.9.15+1KI.9.16+1KI.9.17+1KI.9.18+1KI.9.19+1KI.9.20+1KI.9.21+1KI.9.22+1KI.9.23+1KI.9.24+1KI.9.25+1KI.9.26+1KI.9.27+1KI.9.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Abam 9:10-28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko hashize imyaka mirongwibiri, ari yo Salomo yubakiyemw’ ingoro y’Uhoraho n’ iyiwe ubgiwe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Salomo asanura ibisagara Huramu yari yaramuhaye, abigerēramw’ Abisirayeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Salomo atera i Hamati‐zoba, arahanesha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Araheza yubaka igisagara c’i Tadumori mu bugaragwa, n’ibisagara vyose vy’ ibigega, ivyo yubatse i Hamati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yubaka n’i Beti‐horoni ho haruguru n’i Beti‐horoni ho hepfo, ibisagara bizitijwe inzitiro z’amabuye, bifise inzugi mu marembo n’ibihindizo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yubaka n’i Bayalati, n’ibindi bisagara vyose vy’ ibigega vyiwe, n’ibisagara vyose vyo kubīkamw’ imikogote yiwe, n’ivy’ abagendera ku mafarasi biwe, n’amazu yose yagomvye kwubaka i Yerusalemu n’i Lebanoni no mu gihugu cose yaganza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu bose b’amasigarira y’ Abaheti n’Abamori n’Abaferizi n’Abahiwi n’Abayebusi, abatār’ Abisirayeli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abuzukuruza babo bari barasigaye mu gihugu, abo Abisirayeli batāranduye, abo ni bo Salomo yatōjemw’ abo gushinga ibikebere, abahindura abaja na bugingo n’ubu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko mu Bisirayeli bo, nta bo yahinduye abaja ngo bamukorere; ariko bār’ ingabo zo kuja mu ntambara, n’ abagabisha bakuru b’ingabo, n’ abagaba abagendera ku mafarasi n’imikogote. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo ni bo bakoresha bakuru babgiririza Salomo; bose na bose bar’ amajana abiri na mirongwitanu, bābgiriza abantu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
